# Real geospatial datasets — these are large binary files that don't
# belong in git. Keep the folder structure and its README, drop everything
# else you place inside for real Sentinel-2/CHIRPS/JRC processing.
backend/data/boundaries/*.geojson
backend/data/sentinel2/*.tif
backend/data/chirps/*.tif
backend/data/surface_water/*.tif
!backend/data/README.md

